{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Ouch, My Back!"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Late Night Call"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to speak up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to speak louder"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could you please speak up a little?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about health care."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inflammation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "redness or swollen part of the body "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need help with the pain and inflammation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "battered"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "injured"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I haven't felt this battered in a while."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob07aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "homeopathic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "using natural substances"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I went to an interesting seminar about homeopathic treatments."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob07aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "alternative"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not usual "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many interesting ideas for alternative treatments."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob07aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "therapy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "treatment to heal an injury"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to try some alternative therapies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob07aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "turmeric"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bright yellow spice"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Add a tablespoon of turmeric to milk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob07aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to check in"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask how someone is"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I call tomorrow to check in?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob07aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Present Perfect Continuous vs Present Perfect"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action or an action that began in the past that is connected to the present in some way. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use Present Perfect Continuous tense to describe: <ul>\t<li>a single activity that lasts a long time, and</li> <li>an action that is repeated over a long period of time.</li></ul> These continue up to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about experience. When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/>  <span class=\"italic\">I have learned English =  I learned English in the past and now I can speak English</span>.<br/> <span class=\"italic\">He has bought a painting = He bought the painting in the past and now he has a painting.</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Present Perfect Continuous tense when a long activity has just stopped."}, {"type": "text", "content": "To emphasize the action, use the continuous form.<br/> <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">We've been working really hard for a couple of months.</li></span><li><span class=\"italic\">She's been having a hard time. </li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To emphasize the result of the action, use the simple form.<br/> <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">I've made fifteen phone calls this morning.</span></li> <span class=\"italic\"><li>He's written a very good report.</li></span></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verb+ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talking on the phone <span class=\\\"strong\\\">for</span> an hour.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" working there <span class=\\\"strong\\\">since</span> 2010.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>You use FOR to talk about how long an action has been happening (a week, 2 days, five hours, six years etc.)</li><li>You use SINCE to talk about when the action started (2010, Monday, she was a child)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've been training with a personal trainer for two weeks."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I haven't had any free time since I started there."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Favors"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " There are different ways to ask for favors. Favors are things we would like other people to do for us. It is best to be as polite as possible when asking for favors."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use modals to ask for favors."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/> Could/Would you + verb, please?<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Could you speak up a little, please?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use an if-clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "  For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I was wondering <span class=\"strong\">if you could </span>give me some ideas to help with the pain.</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">Would it be ok <span class=\"strong\">if I called</span> tomorrow?</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you please recommend some alternative therapies?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Would it be ok if I used this?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I was wondering if you could give me some ideas."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le03ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine your partner is someone who you haven't seen in awhile."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between you and your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask each other what you have been doing lately."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask for a favor."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue asking about recent history."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about recent actions and routines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask someone a favor."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_ov