override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Grandma</span>: \tHello?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tHi, Grandma. How are you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grandma</span>: \tVanessa! How lovely to hear your voice. It's been a while since we last talked. Could you please speak up a little? It's hard to hear you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t Is this better?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grandma</span>: \tYes. You don't sound too good. Are you ok?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t Actually, I'm laid up in bed with a sore foot and swollen thumb! I injured myself bowling today.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grandma</span>: \tOh, dear!", "time": "100", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tI was wondering if you could give me some ideas to help with the pain and inflammation. I haven't felt this physically battered in a while. I need some old fashioned remedies. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grandma</span>: \tI've actually been going to seminars on homeopathic treatments recently. I've met some wonderful people who have given me many ideas for alternative therapies. It's really helped my arthritis. If I were you, I'd take a tablespoon of turmeric, add it to boiling water, let it cool and take half a teaspoon of the paste with milk.", "time": "34500", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le03ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tI've been suffering for hours now. I'll definitely give that a shot. Thanks Aunt Nelly.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grandma</span>: \tYou're welcome, my dear. Would it be ok if I called you tomorrow to check in?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tOf course!", "time": "68000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le03ob07re2aud01", "coverimg"